Development in this derivative
------------------------------
The upstream already used the official CST Python API. This project builds
on that implementation and its tool catalog. Additions and revisions include:
- Explicit session attachment/launch controls, solver-busy and existing-result
  guards, timeout handling, VBA validation, and isolation of MCP stdout
  (session.py, vba_safety.py, server.py and tools/connection.py).
- Complex saved-result reading/analysis and local official-help search
  (execution/results_reader.py, execution/results_api.py, tools/official.py).
- Publication figures, farfield metrics and STL-based technical drawings
  (execution/figures_*, execution/farfield*, execution/drawing_*).
- Real inset-notch cuts, coaxial probe geometry and RF workflow corrections
  (domain/antennas/patch.py, tools/workflows.py, tools/antenna_templates.py,
  tools/ports.py and execution/port_helpers.py).
- Offline regression tests and usage/validation documentation (tests/, docs/).
These descriptions identify concrete development areas, not exclusive claims
to the underlying algorithms or to all code in those areas.

